{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124310","id":4794425932,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHcUiTA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124310","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124310.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124310.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124310","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124310/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124310/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124310/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/31302567140243c00fd8b93830574c3570d0abb0","number":124310,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't upscale the stencil component of the depth/stencil buffer in the Compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119317\n\n#119317 is a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/80710\n\nWhen both the depth and stencil bits are present and the texture is being upscaled during a blit, then ANGLE falls back on this code path https://github.com/google/angle/blob/d2e5e488da0c6215f8276e5b8d992a4a6ec20c32/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/Blit11.cpp#L1229-L1341\n\nWhich copies the stencil bits to a staging buffer, then upscales on the CPU and re-uploads the new texture. This absolutely kills performance. \n\nYou can reproduce the issue both on web, or on desktop when using gles3_angle. \n\nThis fix is a safe and minimal and should be included in 4.8. However, I question why we would upscale depth in the first place. It doesn't make any sense to me. @BastiaanOlij do you remember why you added upscaling for depth in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/83976? It seems like a total waste since it happens after post processing, so the depth buffer isn't used anymore. \n\nWe could save a bunch more performance by removing the blit entirely, but I am not comfortable doing that until I know why it is there in the first place. \n\nWith this change, running a basic scene with 0.1 scaling with gles3_angle goes from 350 FPS to 7000 FPS (matching 1.0 scaling)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-09T00:29:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T16:09:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09